{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14367","headline":"和丘员外题湛长史旧居 · 韦夏卿","name":"和丘员外题湛长史旧居","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"道胜物能齐，累轻身易退。\n苟安一丘上，何必三山外。\n云霞长若绮，松石常如黛。\n徒有昔王过，竟遗青史载。\n诗因埜寺咏，酒向山椒酹。\n异时逢尔知，兹辰驻余斾。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦夏卿","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14367.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14367","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}